Package: dev.cellblock.tumble
Name: Tumble
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Shake your phone and the home screen icons get gravity: they fall, bounce and spin. Shake again to put them back. Settings in TweakSettings.
Maintainer: Cellblock
Author: Cellblock
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Icon: file:///Library/PreferenceLoader/Preferences/Tumble.png
